"http://hostname:631/ipp/port1\n\n    ipp://hostname/ipp/\n    "
"ipp://hostname/ipp/port1\n\n    lpd://hostname/queue\n\n    "
"socket://hostname\n    socket://hostname:9100\n</PRE>\n\n<P>មើល <A "
"HREF=\"/help/network.html\" TARGET=\"_blank\">\"បណ្ដាញ\nម៉ាស៊ីន​បោះពុម្ព\"</A> "
